flowchart LR
    subgraph PI["Raspberry Pi Edge Node"]
        STATE[Latest queue state<br/>length, wait, comfort, sensors]
        SYNC[Hub Sync Agent<br/>runs every 2.5 s]
        CACHE[Peer Site Cache<br/>nearby site status]
        SQLITE[(SQLite<br/>QueueSnapshot<br/>PersonEvent<br/>PeerSiteSnapshot)]
    end

    subgraph CF["Cloudflare Workers"]
        INGEST["POST /api/ingest<br/>authenticate X-Api-Key"]
        SITES["GET /api/sites<br/>current site states"]
        HISTORY["GET /api/history<br/>historical snapshots"]
    end

    D1[(Cloudflare D1<br/>site_status + site_snapshots)]
    DASH[Dashboard Browser]

    STATE -->|read latest status| SYNC
    STATE -->|local snapshots<br/>person events| SQLITE
    SYNC <-->|push local status JSON| INGEST
    INGEST -->|upsert current<br/>insert snapshot| D1

    SYNC <-->|pull peer sites| SITES
    SITES -->|query current status| D1
    SYNC -->|update| CACHE
    SYNC -->|mirror pulled peers| SQLITE

    DASH <-->|browse current queues| SITES
    DASH <-->|request trend data| HISTORY
    HISTORY -->|query snapshots| D1

    classDef pi fill:#E7F0FF,stroke:#315C9B,color:#13294B
    classDef worker fill:#F2ECFF,stroke:#6C47B8,color:#24133F
    classDef data fill:#FFF4D6,stroke:#A66A00,color:#3F2600
    classDef user fill:#E8F7EC,stroke:#3F8C55,color:#12351C

    class STATE,SYNC,CACHE pi
    class SQLITE data
    class INGEST,SITES,HISTORY worker
    class D1 data
    class DASH user
